Third-party material in this repository:

* provette/agent/nemotron3_nano/chat_template.jinja and tokenizer_config.json are the tokenizer
  files of NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B, fetched unchanged from Hugging Face and governed by
  the NVIDIA Nemotron Open Model License, not by the Apache License. The NOTE file beside them
  says where they came from and why they are here; nothing imports them at run time.

* Labware definitions are read at run time from the installed `opentrons` package (Apache-2.0)
  and are not copied here. The Opentrons protocol library (D-10 in DECISIONS.md) is fetched at
  run time into .cache/ and never committed; the repository holds slugs, line numbers, findings
  and short quoted snippets only.

* The test fixtures under tests/fixtures and the requests under eval/ were written for this
  project.
